<h1>Your studio is ready 🎉</h1>
<p>Hi <%= @user.name.presence || @user.email %>, welcome to StudioFlow! Your account has been created and your studio is live.</p>

<div class="studio-badge">
  <span>Studio</span>
  <%= @studio.name %>
</div>

<p>Here's what you can do right now:</p>
<ul class="checklist">
  <li>Add class templates and locations</li>
  <li>Schedule sessions and manage your calendar</li>
  <li>Invite clients to join your studio</li>
  <li>Set up payments and memberships</li>
</ul>

<a href="<%= @login_url %>" class="btn">Go to your studio</a>

<hr class="divider">

<p style="font-size:13px;color:#64748b">If you have any questions, reply to this email and we'll be happy to help.</p>

<% content_for :footer do %>
  You received this email because you signed up as a studio owner on StudioFlow.
<% end %>
